licensed under Apache-2.0 OR BSL-1.0 (see vendor/ryu/LICENSE-Apache and
vendor/ryu/LICENSE-Boost). Our fork changes one configuration constant
(`accept_bounds = false`) so the output matches PostgreSQL's observable float
