This product includes a hard fork of the `sqlparser` crate (Apache DataFusion's
sqlparser-rs), vendored in-tree as the source of crates/crabgresql-parser
(the ast/, dialect/, parser/ modules and supporting files):

  Copyright the Apache Software Foundation and the sqlparser-rs authors
