license headers are preserved. The fork point is upstream tag v0.62.0 (see
crates/crabgresql-parser/UPSTREAM). Our copy diverges over time to add
PostgreSQL-specific grammar not present upstream.

This product includes the special functions erf, erfc, tgamma and lgamma
(crates/crabgresql-executor/src/special_fns.rs), vendored from the FreeBSD/msun
math library as ported by the `libm` crate (github.com/rust-lang/libm):

